When looking up the configured default team fails (unavailable), interactive create fails instead of silently asking for another team.
-- env --
LINEAR_TEAM_KEY=OLD
LINEAR_ISSUE_CREATE_ASSIGN_SELF=never
LINEAR_ISSUE_CREATE_ASK_PROJECT=false
-- faults.json --
[{"on": "query", "nth": 1, "action": "status", "status": 200, "body": {"data": null, "errors": [{"message": "Team lookup unavailable"}]}}]
-- tty --
expect What's the title of your issue?
send Draft\r
-- run --
linear issue create
-- stdout --
{{*}}✗ Failed to create issue: Team lookup unavailable
-- exit --
1
-- mutations.json --
{}
